title: v6.0.1 — University content refreshed for v6.0 reality
summary: University content patch addressing material staleness surfaced by Sheila's audit + Jinx's pre-mortem after v6.0.0 shipped. PLSAT exam integrity restored (multiple slots previously marked the now-removed `type:'decision'` as a valid lore type). PARA 501 lore-system + PARA 301 wisdom-system structurally rewritten (not surgical). PARA 001 meet-the-team, PARA 401 mcp-tools-overview, PARA 601 knowledge-streams refreshed for v6 reality. 8 sibling quizzes + reference.json cleaned. New canonical N-para-301-decisions.md + paired quiz wired into LP-para-301. 25 files total. Builder verified two of Jinx's claims wrong (`LORE_TYPE_TO_STREAM` exists; slot-053's 0.6 threshold is correct) and caught 4-5 additional stale files neither plan listed. Safe to ship in place — no v3 PLSAT diplomas exist.
